{"name":"Heaven Sent","hex":"#eee1eb","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"heaven-sent","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Fortunate, appropriate, opportune or providential, as (or as if) ordained by God; godsent."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/heaven-sent"}],"entries":[{"title":"Heaven Sent (film)","blocks":[{"text":"Heaven Sent  is a 1963 French comedy film directed by Jean-Pierre Mocky. It was entered into the 13th Berlin International Film Festival. The film has been released under the name Heaven Sent in the English speaking world."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/e/ef/Un-drole-de-paroissien.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Heaven_Sent_(film)"},{"title":"Heaven Sent (Doctor Who)","blocks":[{"text":"\"Heaven Sent\" is the eleventh and penultimate episode of the ninth series of the British science fiction television series Doctor Who. It was first broadcast on BBC One on 28 November 2015. It was written by Steven Moffat and directed by Rachel Talalay."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/c/ce/Doctor_Who_Heaven_Sent_Scene.jpg/330px-Doctor_Who_Heaven_Sent_Scene.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Heaven_Sent_(Doctor_Who)"},{"title":"Heaven","blocks":[{"text":"Heaven, or the Heavens, is a common religious cosmological or supernatural place where beings such as deities, angels, souls, saints, or venerated ancestors are said to originate, be enthroned, or reside. According to the beliefs of some religions, heavenly beings can descend to Earth or incarnate and earthly beings can ascend to Heaven in the afterlife or, in exceptional cases, enter Heaven without dying."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/eb/Paradiso_Canto_31_%28148200393%29.jpg/330px-Paradiso_Canto_31_%28148200393%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Heaven"},{"title":"Sending","blocks":[{"text":"Sending, or to send, is the action of conveying or directing something or someone to another physical, virtual, or conceptual location for a specific purpose. The initiator of the action of sending is the sender. With respect to humans, \"sending\" also encompasses instructing others to go to another physical location, whether voluntarily or by force."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a3/Paketbana_i_varudistributionen_p%C3%A5_varuhuset_Nordiska_Kompaniet_NMA.0099957.jpg/330px-Paketbana_i_varudistributionen_p%C3%A5_varuhuset_Nordiska_Kompaniet_NMA.0099957.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sending"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/68/Doctor_Who_Experience_%2830855119501%29.jpg/500px-Doctor_Who_Experience_%2830855119501%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/68/Doctor_Who_Experience_%2830855119501%29.jpg/1280px-Doctor_Who_Experience_%2830855119501%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/68/Doctor_Who_Experience_%2830855119501%29.jpg/500px-Doctor_Who_Experience_%2830855119501%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"The shrouded figure, referred to as the \"Veil\" in the credits, as shown at the Doctor Who Experience.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ADoctor_Who_Experience_(30855119501).jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6f/Doctor_Who_Experience_%2829349401791%29.jpg/500px-Doctor_Who_Experience_%2829349401791%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x,